        instruction = "However, the fight is easily soloable by most jobs at level 70+. Though, it is recommended to have a consistent form of dealing physical and magical damage due to the Shadow Lord's behaviour. It is also recommended to have Sneak and Invisible for lower level party members to reduce unwanted battle on the way up. Thus, having a stack of Prism Powder and Silent Oil might be a good idea, if needed.",
