      {
        order = 24,
        marker = "***",
        depth = 3,
        instruction = "In the first phase, he alternates between physical and magic immunity. He has magic immunity until around 50% HP, then starts to switch to physical. From this point he will switch about every 5 minutes or 1000 damage.",
