        depth = 3,
        instruction = "Melee should use their two-hour abilities, and Icarus Wing, if possible, to have TP for their best weaponskill. Mages should cast their Curaga spells, and try to keep Stoneskin and other possible buffs such as Phalanx up, if available.",
