        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Then go talk to Moreno-Toeno (inside the Aurastery) at Windurst Waters North L-6. He'll send you off to Tahrongi Canyon with a \"Creature Counter\" magic doll (you may need to speak to him twice to get the cutscene).",
