        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Once in Tahrongi, you need to kill at least 30 monsters. As noted before, you only have 1 hour to kill them and get back, so you probably want to go after monsters that will go down quickly. Make sure to keep good track of your kills, as there is no tracker to check the running total or number remaining.",
